B.eX=new A.ji(6,"sadaqaJariya")
B.UN=new A.aO(B.eX,"\ud83d\udc9d","Sadaqa Jariya","UpYourDeen est gratuite et le restera toujours, insha'Allah. Mais si tu veux soutenir le projet, chaque don est une sadaqa jariya : tant que quelqu'un apprend gr\xe2ce \xe0 UpYourDeen, tu en r\xe9coltes les r\xe9compenses. M\xeame apr\xe8s ta mort.","Soutenir UpYourDeen",null,"Sadaqa Jariya","UpYourDeen is free and will always be, insha'Allah. But if you want to support the project, every donation is a sadaqa jariya: as long as someone learns through UpYourDeen, you reap the rewards. Even after your death.","Support UpYourDeen")
B.Ul=new A.aO(B.eX,"\ud83c\udf0d","Aide-nous \xe0 grandir","Chaque verset lu sur UpYourDeen, chaque histoire apprise par un enfant, chaque dhikr r\xe9cit\xe9... tout \xe7a gr\xe2ce \xe0 des gens comme toi. Un don, m\xeame de 1\u20ac, aide \xe0 maintenir cette lumi\xe8re allum\xe9e.","Contribuer",null,"Help us grow","Every verse read on UpYourDeen, every story learned by a child, every dhikr recited... it's all thanks to people like you. Even 1\u20ac helps keep this light on.","Contribute")
B.Uo=new A.aO(B.eX,"\ud83d\udce2","Partage UpYourDeen autour de toi","Le Proph\xe8te \ufdfa a dit : \xab Celui qui guide vers un bien a la m\xeame r\xe9compense que celui qui le fait. \xbb Partage UpYourDeen avec un ami, un cousin, un voisin. C'est une sadaqa gratuite !","Partager",null,"Share UpYourDeen with others",'The Prophet \ufdfa said: "Whoever guides someone to good has the same reward as the one who does it." Share UpYourDeen with a friend, cousin, neighbor. It\'s free sadaqa!',"Share")
B.V2=new A.aO(B.eX,"\ud83e\udd32","Une du'a pour UpYourDeen","Si tu ne peux pas donner d'argent, fais une du'a pour que UpYourDeen aide le plus de musulmans possible. La du'a est la plus belle des aum\xf4nes.",null,null,"Make du'a for UpYourDeen","If you can't give money, make du'a for UpYourDeen to help as many Muslims as possible. Du'a is the most beautiful form of charity.",null)
B.V6=new A.aO(B.eX,"\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc66","Offre UpYourDeen \xe0 une famille","Tu connais une famille qui cherche \xe0 \xe9duquer ses enfants dans l'Islam ? Parle-leur de UpYourDeen. Les histoires des proph\xe8tes, le Coran, les hadiths... tout est l\xe0, gratuit.","Partager",null,"Give UpYourDeen to a family","Do you know a family wanting to educate their children in Islam? Tell them about UpYourDeen. Prophet stories, Quran, hadiths... it's all here, free.","Share")
B.Vs=new A.aO(B.eX,"\ud83d\udc8e","L'investissement \xe9ternel","Le Proph\xe8te \ufdfa a dit que 3 choses profitent au croyant apr\xe8s sa mort : un enfant pieux, un savoir utile, et une sadaqa jariya. En soutenant UpYourDeen, tu cumules les 3.","Investir",null,"The eternal investment","The Prophet \ufdfa said 3 things benefit a believer after death: a righteous child, beneficial knowledge, and sadaqa jariya. By supporting UpYourDeen, you get all 3.","Invest")
B.UI=new A.aO(B.eX,"\u2b50","Laisse un avis","Tu aimes UpYourDeen ? Laisse un avis 5 \xe9toiles sur l'App Store ou Google Play. Chaque avis aide d'autres musulmans \xe0 d\xe9couvrir l'app. C'est gratuit et c'est une sadaqa !",null,null,"Leave a review","Love UpYourDeen? Leave a 5-star review on the App Store or Google Play. Every review helps other Muslims discover the app. It's free and it's sadaqa!",null)
B.V9=new A.aO(B.eX,"\ud83c\udf19","Ramadan approche","Les r\xe9compenses sont multipli\xe9es pendant le Ramadan. Si tu veux soutenir UpYourDeen, c'est le meilleur moment. Chaque centime donn\xe9 pendant le Ramadan a une valeur d\xe9cupl\xe9e.","Soutenir",null,"Ramadan is coming","Rewards are multiplied in Ramadan. If you want to support UpYourDeen, now's the best time. Every cent given in Ramadan is worth ten times more.","Support")
B.y7=s([B.UN,B.Ul,B.Uo,B.V2,B.V6,B.Vs,B.UI,B.V9],t.Vt)
