B.bQ=new A.ji(5,"rappelPriere")
B.VH=new A.aO(B.bQ,"\ud83d\udd4c","As-tu pri\xe9 aujourd'hui ?","Pas de pression, juste un rappel entre amis. La salat est le premier acte sur lequel on sera interrog\xe9. Si tu l'as faite, alhamdulillah ! Sinon, il est encore temps.",null,null,"Did you pray today?","No pressure, just a friendly reminder. Salat is the first deed we'll be asked about. If you did, alhamdulillah! If not, there's still time.",null)
B.V3=new A.aO(B.bQ,"\ud83d\udcff","Adhkar du matin","Le Proph\xe8te \ufdfa ne commen\xe7ait jamais sa journ\xe9e sans les adhkar du matin. C'est comme une armure invisible. Tu veux les lire ensemble ?","Lire les adhkar","spiritualite","Morning adhkar","The Prophet \ufdfa never started his day without morning adhkar. It's like an invisible armor. Want to read them together?","Read adhkar")
B.UY=new A.aO(B.bQ,"\ud83c\udf19","Adhkar du soir","Avant de dormir, prot\xe8ge-toi avec les adhkar du soir. Ayat al-Kursi, les 3 derni\xe8res sourates... C'est le bouclier de la nuit.","Adhkar du soir","spiritualite","Evening adhkar","Before sleep, protect yourself with evening adhkar. Ayat al-Kursi, the last 3 surahs... It's the shield of the night.","Evening adhkar")
B.Uu=new A.aO(B.bQ,"\u2728","Petit dhikr, grande r\xe9compense","\xab SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi, SubhanAllahi al-Azim. \xbb Deux mots l\xe9gers sur la langue, lourds sur la balance, aim\xe9s du Tout Mis\xe9ricordieux. Dis-les maintenant. \ud83d\udc9b",null,null,"Small dhikr, great reward",'"SubhanAllahi wa bihamdihi, SubhanAllahi al-Azim." Light on the tongue, heavy on the scale, beloved by the Most Merciful. Say them now. \ud83d\udc9b',null)
B.Uk=new A.aO(B.bQ,"\ud83e\udd32","N'oublie pas tes du'as","La du'a, c'est parler directement \xe0 Allah. Pas besoin de mots parfaits, pas besoin d'arabe. Parle-Lui avec ton c\u0153ur, dans ta langue. Il comprend tout.",null,null,"Don't forget your du'as","Du'a is talking directly to Allah. No need for perfect words, no need for Arabic. Speak to Him from your heart, in your language. He understands everything.",null)
B.US=new A.aO(B.bQ,"\ud83d\udd4b","La qibla du c\u0153ur","Quand tu pries, imagine que tu es devant la Ka'ba. Que rien ne te s\xe9pare d'Allah. La salat n'est pas une corv\xe9e \u2014 c'est un rendez-vous intime avec ton Cr\xe9ateur.",null,null,"The qibla of the heart","When you pray, imagine you're standing before the Kaaba. Nothing separates you from Allah. Salat is not a chore\u2014it's an intimate appointment with your Creator.",null)
B.UG=new A.aO(B.bQ,"\ud83c\udf05","Salat al-Fajr","Le Proph\xe8te \ufdfa a dit : \xab Celui qui prie le Fajr est sous la protection d'Allah. \xbb Si tu l'as pri\xe9e ce matin, bravo. Si tu l'as rat\xe9e, fais-la maintenant en rattrapage.",null,null,"Salat al-Fajr",'The Prophet \ufdfa said: "Whoever prays Fajr is under Allah\'s protection." If you prayed it this morning, great! If you missed it, make it up now.',null)
B.UA=new A.aO(B.bQ,"\ud83d\udcab","Istighfar : la cl\xe9 de tout","L'istighfar (demander pardon) ouvre les portes de la subsistance, de la paix et de la r\xe9ussite. \xab Astaghfirullah \xbb \u2014 3 secondes, des r\xe9compenses infinies.",null,null,"Istighfar: the key to everything",'Istighfar (seeking forgiveness) opens doors to provision, peace, and success. "Astaghfirullah"\u20143 seconds, infinite rewards.',null)
B.VN=new A.aO(B.bQ,"\ud83d\udcd6","Sourate Al-Mulk avant de dormir","Le Proph\xe8te \ufdfa ne dormait jamais sans lire Al-Mulk. Elle prot\xe8ge de la punition de la tombe. 67 versets entre toi et la tranquillit\xe9. Tu la lis ce soir ?","Lire Al-Mulk","quran","Surah Al-Mulk before sleep","The Prophet \ufdfa never slept without reading Al-Mulk. It protects from the punishment of the grave. 67 verses between you and peace. Will you read it tonight?","Read Al-Mulk")
B.V_=new A.aO(B.bQ,"\ud83c\udf1f","Salawat sur le Proph\xe8te \ufdfa","Dis \xab Allahumma salli 'ala Muhammad \xbb 10 fois maintenant. Le Proph\xe8te \ufdfa a dit : \xab Celui qui prie sur moi une fois, Allah prie sur lui 10 fois. \xbb Facile et immense.",null,null,"Salawat on the Prophet \ufdfa",'Say "Allahumma salli \'ala Muhammad" 10 times now. The Prophet \ufdfa said: "Whoever sends blessings upon me once, Allah sends blessings upon him 10 times." Easy and immense.',null)
B.VJ=new A.aO(B.bQ,"\ud83c\udf19","Les 2 rak'at de Duha","Entre le lever du soleil et le dhuhr, il y a la pri\xe8re de Duha. M\xeame 2 rak'at suffisent. Le Proph\xe8te \ufdfa la recommandait vivement. C'est un cadeau du milieu de matin\xe9e.",null,null,"The 2 rak'at of Duha","Between sunrise and dhuhr, there's the prayer of Duha. Even 2 rak'at are enough. The Prophet \ufdfa recommended it strongly. It's a mid-morning gift.",null)
B.UC=new A.aO(B.bQ,"\ud83d\udcff","33-33-34","Apr\xe8s chaque pri\xe8re : 33 SubhanAllah, 33 Alhamdulillah, 34 Allahu Akbar. \xc7a prend 2 minutes. Le Proph\xe8te \ufdfa a dit que celui qui fait \xe7a verra ses p\xe9ch\xe9s pardonn\xe9s, m\xeame s'ils \xe9taient comme l'\xe9cume de la mer.","Compter","spiritualite","33-33-34","After each prayer: 33 SubhanAllah, 33 Alhamdulillah, 34 Allahu Akbar. Takes 2 minutes. The Prophet \ufdfa said whoever does this will see their sins forgiven, even if they were like sea foam.","Count")
B.UX=new A.aO(B.bQ,"\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f","Le vendredi, c'est sp\xe9cial","Si c'est vendredi : lis sourate Al-Kahf, fais beaucoup de salawat sur le Proph\xe8te \ufdfa, et multiplie les du'as. Il y a une heure ce jour-l\xe0 o\xf9 toute du'a est exauc\xe9e.","Al-Kahf","quran","Friday is special","If it's Friday: read Surah Al-Kahf, send many blessings upon the Prophet \ufdfa, and multiply your du'as. There's an hour on that day when all du'as are answered.","Al-Kahf")
B.VD=new A.aO(B.bQ,"\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f","Ta protection quotidienne","Ayat al-Kursi le matin, Ayat al-Kursi le soir, Ayat al-Kursi apr\xe8s chaque pri\xe8re. C'est le verset le plus puissant du Coran. Tu le connais par c\u0153ur ?","Roqya","spiritualite","Your daily protection","Ayat al-Kursi in the morning, Ayat al-Kursi in the evening, Ayat al-Kursi after each prayer. It's the most powerful verse in the Quran. Do you know it by heart?","Roqya")
B.Un=new A.aO(B.bQ,"\ud83e\udd32","Du'a pour tes proches","Fais une du'a pour quelqu'un sans qu'il le sache. Le Proph\xe8te \ufdfa a dit : \xab La du'a du musulman pour son fr\xe8re en son absence est exauc\xe9e. Un ange dit : et pour toi de m\xeame. \xbb",null,null,"Du'a for your loved ones","Make du'a for someone without them knowing. The Prophet \ufdfa said: \"The du'a of a Muslim for their brother in their absence is answered. An angel says: and for you likewise.\"",null)
B.a64=s([B.VH,B.V3,B.UY,B.Uu,B.Uk,B.US,B.UG,B.UA,B.VN,B.V_,B.VJ,B.UC,B.UX,B.VD,B.Un],t.Vt)
