B.a6R=s(["Le repentir sinc\xe8re efface les p\xe9ch\xe9s \u2014 Allah est Le Tout-Pardonnant","L'orgueil est le premier p\xe9ch\xe9 (celui d'Iblis)","L'\xeatre humain est honor\xe9 par Allah et a une mission sur terre","Shaytan est un ennemi d\xe9clar\xe9 \u2014 il faut rester vigilant"],t.s)
B.abc=s(["Sincere repentance erases sins \u2014 Allah is The Most Forgiving","Pride is the first sin (that of Iblis)","Mankind is honoured by Allah and has a mission on earth","Shaytan is a declared enemy \u2014 one must remain vigilant"],t.s)
B.aiz=new A.mq("Adam",null,"\u0622\u062f\u0645","\ud83c\udf3f","Le premier homme et proph\xe8te","The first man and prophet","Allah a cr\xe9\xe9 Adam de terre et lui a enseign\xe9 les noms de toutes choses. Les anges se sont prostern\xe9s devant lui sur ordre d'Allah, sauf Iblis qui a refus\xe9 par orgueil. Adam et Hawwa (\xc8ve) vivaient au Paradis mais ont d\xe9sob\xe9i en mangeant de l'arbre interdit, influenc\xe9s par Iblis. Ils se sont repentis sinc\xe8rement et Allah leur a pardonn\xe9, puis les a envoy\xe9s sur terre comme Ses repr\xe9sentants (khalifas).","Allah created Adam from clay and taught him the names of all things. The angels prostrated before him on Allah's command, except Iblis who refused out of pride. Adam and Hawwa (Eve) lived in Paradise but disobeyed by eating from the forbidden tree, influenced by Iblis. They repented sincerely and Allah forgave them, then sent them to earth as His representatives (khalifas).",B.a6R,B.abc,"Quand ton Seigneur dit aux anges : Je vais \xe9tablir un repr\xe9sentant sur la terre.","When your Lord said to the angels: I am going to place a representative on the earth.","Al-Baqara, 2:30")
B.a6t=s(["La patience dans la pr\xe9dication \u2014 950 ans sans abandonner","La foi ne se transmet pas par le sang mais par le choix","Allah sauve les croyants m\xeame dans les pires \xe9preuves","L'obstination dans le p\xe9ch\xe9 m\xe8ne \xe0 la destruction"],t.s)
B.a6W=s(["Patience in calling to Allah \u2014 950 years without giving up","Faith is not inherited through blood but chosen personally","Allah saves believers even in the worst of trials","Persistence in sin leads to destruction"],t.s)
B.aix=new A.mq("Nouh (No\xe9)","Nuh (Noah)","\u0646\u0648\u062d","\ud83d\udea2","Le proph\xe8te de la patience","The prophet of patience","Nouh a pr\xeach\xe9 le monoth\xe9isme pendant 950 ans \xe0 un peuple obstin\xe9 dans l'idol\xe2trie. Malgr\xe9 les moqueries et le rejet, il n'a jamais abandonn\xe9. Allah lui a ordonn\xe9 de construire une arche, et le D\xe9luge a englouti les m\xe9cr\xe9ants. M\xeame le fils de Nouh a refus\xe9 de monter \xe0 bord, montrant que la foi est un choix personnel, pas un h\xe9ritage.","Nuh preached monotheism for 950 years to a people stubbornly attached to idol worship. Despite mockery and rejection, he never gave up. Allah commanded him to build an ark, and the Flood overwhelmed the disbelievers. Even Nuh's own son refused to board, showing that faith is a personal choice, not an inheritance.",B.a6t,B.a6W,"No\xe9 invoqua son Seigneur : Je suis vaincu, secours-moi !","Noah called upon his Lord: I am overcome, so help me!","Al-Qamar, 54:10")
B.a9q=s(["La soumission totale \xe0 Allah (l'Islam dans son essence)","Utiliser la raison pour trouver la v\xe9rit\xe9","Allah prot\xe8ge ceux qui Lui font confiance","L'\xe9preuve d'Allah est une \xe9l\xe9vation, pas une punition"],t.s)
B.a8g=s(["Total submission to Allah (the essence of Islam)","Using reason to find the truth","Allah protects those who trust in Him","Allah's trial is an elevation, not a punishment"],t.s)
B.aiy=new A.mq("Ibrahim (Abraham)",null,"\u0625\u0628\u0631\u0627\u0647\u064a\u0645","\ud83d\udd25","L'ami intime d'Allah","The intimate friend of Allah","Ibrahim a rejet\xe9 l'idol\xe2trie de son peuple et de son p\xe8re en utilisant la raison. Jet\xe9 dans un feu par le roi Nimrod, Allah l'a prot\xe9g\xe9. Il a \xe9t\xe9 \xe9prouv\xe9 par l'ordre de sacrifier son fils Isma\xefl \u2014 tous deux se sont soumis \xe0 la volont\xe9 d'Allah, qui les a r\xe9compens\xe9s. Ibrahim a construit la Ka'ba avec Isma\xefl et est l'anc\xeatre commun des proph\xe8tes.","Ibrahim rejected the idolatry of his people and his father through reason. Thrown into a fire by King Nimrod, Allah protected him. He was tested by the command to sacrifice his son Ismail \u2014 both submitted to the will of Allah, who rewarded them. Ibrahim built the Ka'ba with Ismail and is the common ancestor of the prophets.",B.a9q,B.a8g,"Quand son Seigneur lui dit : Soumets-toi ! Il dit : Je me soumets au Seigneur des mondes.","When his Lord said to him: Submit! He said: I submit to the Lord of the worlds.","Al-Baqara, 2:131")
B.a65=s(["La patience face \xe0 l'injustice m\xe8ne \xe0 l'\xe9l\xe9vation","La chastet\xe9 et l'int\xe9grit\xe9 m\xeame dans la difficult\xe9","Le pardon est plus noble que la vengeance","Allah a un plan m\xeame quand on ne le comprend pas"],t.s)
B.a9j=s(["Patience in the face of injustice leads to elevation","Chastity and integrity even in hardship","Forgiveness is nobler than revenge","Allah has a plan even when we do not understand it"],t.s)
B.aiw=new A.mq("Youssef (Joseph)","Yusuf (Joseph)","\u064a\u0648\u0633\u0641","\ud83c\udf1f","La plus belle des histoires","The most beautiful of stories","Youssef, fils de Ya'qub, a \xe9t\xe9 jet\xe9 dans un puits par ses fr\xe8res jaloux, vendu comme esclave en \xc9gypte, accus\xe9 injustement et emprisonn\xe9. Malgr\xe9 toutes ces \xe9preuves, il est rest\xe9 patient et fid\xe8le \xe0 Allah. Il est devenu ministre d'\xc9gypte gr\xe2ce \xe0 son don d'interpr\xe9tation des r\xeaves et a pardonn\xe9 \xe0 ses fr\xe8res quand ils sont venus \xe0 lui.","Yusuf, son of Ya'qub, was thrown into a well by his jealous brothers, sold into slavery in Egypt, falsely accused and imprisoned. Despite all these trials, he remained patient and faithful to Allah. He became minister of Egypt through his gift of interpreting dreams and forgave his brothers when they came to him.",B.a65,B.a9j,"Certes, quiconque craint Allah et patiente... Allah ne fait pas perdre la r\xe9compense des bienfaisants.","Indeed, whoever fears Allah and is patient... Allah does not allow to be lost the reward of those who do good.","Yusuf, 12:90")
B.a5T=s(["Allah choisit Ses messagers selon Sa sagesse","Le courage face \xe0 la tyrannie est un devoir","Allah transforme la faiblesse en force","La gratitude apr\xe8s la d\xe9livrance est essentielle"],t.s)
B.a5o=s(["Allah chooses His messengers according to His wisdom","Courage in the face of tyranny is a duty","Allah transforms weakness into strength","Gratitude after deliverance is essential"],t.s)
B.aiB=new A.mq("Moussa (Mo\xefse)","Musa (Moses)","\u0645\u0648\u0633\u0649","\ud83c\udf0a","Le proph\xe8te le plus cit\xe9 dans le Coran","The most mentioned prophet in the Quran","Moussa est le proph\xe8te le plus mentionn\xe9 dans le Coran. Sauv\xe9 des eaux \xe9tant b\xe9b\xe9, \xe9lev\xe9 dans le palais de Pharaon, il a fui en Madian o\xf9 Allah lui a parl\xe9 au buisson ardent. Il est retourn\xe9 en \xc9gypte pour affronter Pharaon et lib\xe9rer les Fils d'Isra\xebl. Allah a fendu la mer pour le sauver et lui a donn\xe9 la Torah au mont Sina\xef.","Musa is the most mentioned prophet in the Quran. Saved from the waters as a baby and raised in Pharaoh's palace, he fled to Madyan where Allah spoke to him through a burning bush. He returned to Egypt to confront Pharaoh and liberate the Children of Israel. Allah parted the sea to save him and gave him the Torah on Mount Sinai.",B.a5T,B.a5o,"Va vers Pharaon, car il a transgress\xe9 toute limite.","Go to Pharaoh, for he has transgressed all bounds.","Ta-Ha, 20:24")
B.a6e=s(["Les miracles viennent d'Allah seul, pas des proph\xe8tes","L'humilit\xe9 dans la servitude envers Allah","La puret\xe9 de Maryam comme mod\xe8le pour les croyants","Le monoth\xe9isme est le message de tous les proph\xe8tes"],t.s)
B.a78=s(["Miracles come from Allah alone, not from the prophets","Humility in servitude to Allah","The purity of Maryam as a model for believers","Monotheism is the message of all the prophets"],t.s)
B.aiA=new A.mq("Issa (J\xe9sus)","Isa (Jesus)","\u0639\u064a\u0633\u0649","\u2728","Le Messie, serviteur d'Allah","The Messiah, servant of Allah","Issa est n\xe9 miraculeusement de Maryam (Marie) sans p\xe8re, par la volont\xe9 d'Allah. Il a accompli de nombreux miracles : gu\xe9rir les aveugles et les l\xe9preux, ressusciter les morts, avec la permission d'Allah. Il a pr\xeach\xe9 le monoth\xe9isme pur et annonc\xe9 la venue du dernier proph\xe8te. Selon le Coran, il n'a pas \xe9t\xe9 crucifi\xe9 mais \xe9lev\xe9 au ciel par Allah, et il reviendra \xe0 la fin des temps.","Issa was born miraculously from Maryam (Mary) without a father, by the will of Allah. He performed many miracles: healing the blind and lepers, raising the dead, with Allah's permission. He preached pure monotheism and announced the coming of the final prophet. According to the Quran, he was not crucified but was raised to heaven by Allah, and he will return at the end of times.",B.a6e,B.a78,"Le Messie Issa fils de Maryam n'est qu'un messager d'Allah, Sa parole qu'Il envoya \xe0 Maryam, et un esprit venant de Lui.","The Messiah Issa son of Maryam is only a messenger of Allah, His word which He directed to Maryam, and a soul from Him.","An-Nisa, 4:171")
B.aaX=s(["La mis\xe9ricorde est au c\u0153ur du message islamique","La patience dans l'\xe9preuve m\xe8ne au succ\xe8s","Le Proph\xe8te \ufdfa est le mod\xe8le parfait de comportement","L'Islam est un message universel pour toute l'humanit\xe9"],t.s)
B.a5r=s(["Mercy is at the heart of the Islamic message","Patience in trial leads to success","The Prophet \ufdfa is the perfect model of behaviour","Islam is a universal message for all humanity"],t.s)
B.aiv=new A.mq("Muhammad \ufdfa",null,"\u0645\u062d\u0645\u062f","\ud83d\udd4c","Le sceau des proph\xe8tes","The seal of the prophets","Muhammad \ufdfa est n\xe9 orphelin \xe0 La Mecque en 570. \xc0 40 ans, il a re\xe7u la premi\xe8re r\xe9v\xe9lation du Coran par l'ange Jibril. Pers\xe9cut\xe9 pendant 13 ans \xe0 La Mecque, il a \xe9migr\xe9 \xe0 M\xe9dine (H\xe9gire) o\xf9 il a \xe9tabli la premi\xe8re soci\xe9t\xe9 islamique fond\xe9e sur la justice, la fraternit\xe9 et la mis\xe9ricorde. En 10 ans, il a unifi\xe9 l'Arabie et transmis le message final d'Allah \xe0 l'humanit\xe9 enti\xe8re.","Muhammad \ufdfa was born an orphan in Mecca in 570. At the age of 40, he received the first revelation of the Quran from the angel Jibril. Persecuted for 13 years in Mecca, he emigrated to Medina (Hijra) where he established the first Islamic society founded on justice, brotherhood and mercy. Within 10 years, he united Arabia and conveyed Allah's final message to all of humanity.",B.aaX,B.a5r,"Nous ne t'avons envoy\xe9 qu'en mis\xe9ricorde pour les mondes.","And We have not sent you except as a mercy to the worlds.","Al-Anbiya, 21:107")
B.a8L=s([B.aiz,B.aix,B.aiy,B.aiw,B.aiB,B.aiA,B.aiv],A.am("D<mq>"))
