B.WP=new A.eF(u.J,"A'udhu billahi minash-Shaytanir-rajim","Je cherche refuge aupr\xe8s d'Allah contre Satan le maudit. Puis cracher l\xe9g\xe8rement 3 fois \xe0 gauche et changer de c\xf4t\xe9. Ne racontez le cauchemar \xe0 personne.","I seek refuge with Allah from Satan the accursed. Then spit lightly 3 times to the left and change sides. Do not tell anyone about the nightmare.","Muslim",3)
